    "Option_B": "In the central tendency, if values of median and mode are very low, it indicates that the test is very hard.",
    "Option_C": "If the spread of marks is large and reliability is low, the standard error of measurement is also low.",
    "Option_D": "A test for recruitment must have low predictive validity.",
    "Correct_Answer": "Option B",
    "Brief_Explanation": "Low values for median and mode indicate a positively skewed distribution, which mathematically reflects that the test was hard for the group."
  },
